I am in Mumbai.
It is the month of January.
I am outside the airport.
It is nighttime.
The weather is very nice.
There is the scent of the sea in the air.
There is a lot of crowd here.
And there is a lot of light here.
My bags are with me.
There is an airport attendant nearby.
I ask him.
"Hello, brother."
"Hello, madam."
"Brother, where is the prepaid taxi counter?"
"Is it nearby?"
He points ahead.
"Yes madam, the counter is right ahead there."
"Thank you, brother."
I walk toward the taxi counter.
